["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"19.AI眼镜杀手级应用在哪里？影目杨龙昇先给了个相亲的答案 BB方案 PMF SLAM inside out\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-tanpai-市场都在看好ai眼镜-这位创始人说明后两年更难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/68d3da25c54fc635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"摊\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">摊牌｜创业观察</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>市场都在看好AI眼镜，这位创始人说明后两年更难</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他判断当前眼镜市场规模只有两三百万台，还要被苹果、Meta和国内大厂挤压，真正的拐点要等供应链、内容生态和产品同时成熟的2028至2029年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI眼镜</span><span class=\"tag\">AR</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"At The Money: How Do Financial Professionals Invest Their Own Money? spreadsheet optimal behaviorally optimal\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-04-mastersinbiz-连理财专家也提前还房贷-留过多现金-只为心安/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d1b7885ac5e511e1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">23:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>连理财专家也提前还房贷、留过多现金——只为心安</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">50位基金经理、顾问在新书里坦白：明知提前还房贷、持有超额现金在数学上不划算，他们还是这么做了，因为心理安稳比理论回报更重要。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行为金融</span><span class=\"tag\">财富管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Good Fight Club: Trump Rebuked emotional capture rings of commitment stolen pride blue tsunami gerrymandering competitive authoritarianism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-04-goodfight-特朗普选民没有觉醒-只是外层支持被生活成本层层剥落/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>特朗普选民没有觉醒，只是外层支持被生活成本层层剥落</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">物价、汽油和住房成本把特朗普的情感俘获一层层剥开，却没有击穿那个仍然忠诚的核心选民群体。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国政治</span><span class=\"tag\">中期选举</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How To Go From Researcher to Founder CCG CQC SME\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-04-ycsp-说不清解决什么问题-nhs里就没人知道该为你买单/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/968e72a6de5d364b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">9:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>说不清解决什么问题，NHS里就没人知道该为你买单</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">每个创业者都该能一句话说清解决了谁的问题，这样才能被导向NHS里真正管那件事的人，再问他愿不愿意付钱——这才是医疗创业的起点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医疗创新</span><span class=\"tag\">NHS</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Bernhard von Gudden: Ludwig II’s Psychiatrist somatic psychiatry non-restraint policy retrospective diagnosis Pick&#x27;s disease\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-04-stuffmissed-写报告前-医生没见过那位被判精神失常的国王/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">35:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>写报告前，医生没见过那位被判精神失常的国王</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">路德维希二世被废黜的依据，是一份古登从未问诊国王本人、只凭政敌证词写成的精神病报告；两人随后双双溺毙，死因至今成谜。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">精神医学史</span><span class=\"tag\">王室秘闻</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Richard Hanania on Conrad&#x27;s Nostromo, Latin American Crime, and Populism material interests negro liberalism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-04-tyler-一本写于1904年的小说-精准预演了拉美民粹政治的死循环/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/42df6b9f173f5224-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>一本写于1904年的小说，精准预演了拉美民粹政治的死循环</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小说里外国资本把矿业变成国家支柱，也带来发展，但煽动家和腐败将领轮番上位的循环从未被打破——这是拉美政治至今未解的死结。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">拉美政治</span><span class=\"tag\">发展经济学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The New AI Agents That Shop, Plan, and Gossip OpenClaw Moltbook MCP picnic\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-04-a16z-ai助理最大的信任障碍不是隐私泄露-而是让你当众出丑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>AI助理最大的信任障碍不是隐私泄露，而是让你当众出丑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">用户嘴上说担心隐私，真正在意的是不被agent说漏嘴而丢脸——这才是阻碍信任、拖慢渗透的真正瓶颈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">消费产品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Martin Casado on Frontier Model Economics, AI&#x27;s Slowdown, and the Cursor Deal - [Invest Like the Best, EP.498] mythical man month NeoCloud NeoLab OLTP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-04-ilt-最强模型拿下八成市场-但护城河只够撑三到六个月/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5467ed92a069a36b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>最强模型拿下八成市场，但护城河只够撑三到六个月</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">只要市场还在扩张，最前沿的模型就能拿走八成支出；但模型的保质期只有三到六个月，一旦掉队几乎没有长尾可言，护城河随时清零。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">前沿模型经济学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Big Beef: The War on Your Wallet | A Bloody Business | 1 boxed beef vertical integration Packers Consent Decree feedlot class action\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-04-businesswars-撤销一纸同意令-牛肉加工业集中度十年内翻倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d30f1b7fb3078628-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">41:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Business Wars</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>撤销一纸同意令，牛肉加工业集中度十年内翻倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1981年里根政府放行后，四大肉企十年内从控制三成牛肉加工暴涨到控制八成，用并购而非技术垄断了市场。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">反垄断</span><span class=\"tag\">供应链议价权</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"徕芬科技创始人叶洪新×罗永浩！初中毕业后，我先造飞机去了...... FA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-04-cn2d7912-读书只读到初中毕业-他把吹风机做到了全球销量第一/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9155e2c533270be3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">3:19:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>读书只读到初中毕业，他把吹风机做到了全球销量第一</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他造载人飞行器、卖电动滑板车两次烧光借来的钱，却靠自学攒下的无刷电机技术，后来把吹风机做到戴森五分之一的价格，卖成全球销量第一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硬件创业</span><span class=\"tag\">国产替代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"⚡️ The 2026 Software Factory Standard — Zach Lloyd, Warp.dev software factory harness scorers / online evals factory engineering ADLC/SDLC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-latentspace-pr成本从80美元砍到20美元-不是换模型-是把工厂写成代码/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c081d94ef2cea125-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">34:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>PR成本从80美元砍到20美元，不是换模型，是把工厂写成代码</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Warp把内部软件工厂整个定义成代码并接入观测闭环后，靠「观察-测量-调优」把每个PR成本从80美元压到15到20美元，PR吞吐同时提升40%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">软件工厂</span><span class=\"tag\">agent编排</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"3 new scandals show being a pain in the ass for AI labs is a legit job now | Rob Wiblin looped transformers chain of thought non-disparagement agreement federal preemption Not For Private Gain campaign\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-eightythousand-anthropic的法案让人几乎没法叫停危险的ai训练/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d70069c16841d26d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">29:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic的法案让人几乎没法叫停危险的AI训练</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法案把叫停权压缩成商务部长签字、一家特区法院45天内拍板，模型真出事时几乎来不及按下刹车。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI监管</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"E208 A股又是大震荡，价值投资的实践、挑战和思考 | 永庆、David 对谈弘尚资产张骏\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-touzishizhan-亏钱不是a股的错-是你对它的认知不够/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/478f2b894977699e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"投\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">投资实战派</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>亏钱不是A股的错，是你对它的认知不够</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">张骏复盘今年60多的累计回撤后发现，A股牛短熊长、资金久期短的根源，从来不是市场本身，而是投资者对公司内在价值和宏观周期的认知跟不上变化的速度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">价值投资</span><span class=\"tag\">内在价值</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"老黄经济学：一口气看懂英伟达的商业帝国 Jevons Paradox DSXPORT Productive / Fungible / Durable circular financing ACIE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-laoshi-下一财年-英伟达四分之一营收要靠自己给客户撑腰/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e1f942ceb55eb0d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"老\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">老石谈芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>下一财年，英伟达四分之一营收要靠自己给客户撑腰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英伟达一边把GPU包装成可融资资产，一边自掏腰包投资AI实验室、帮客户垫钱买自己的芯片，循环融资撑起营收，也让应收账款飙到631亿美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力经济</span><span class=\"tag\">循环融资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Roasting China&#x27;s AI Industry (中文版) benchmark RSI scaling law PMF\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-chinatalk-大模型是制造业不是魔法-谁都别想领先超过一个月/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ae93881f9f6bfed0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>大模型是制造业不是魔法：谁都别想领先超过一个月</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">丧钟AI的作者认为，大模型厂没有任何能保密的技术差异，数据和算力就是生产资料，这和光伏、手机、电动车的逻辑一样——谁的领先都撑不过一个月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">国产大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">视频生成模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The company building America’s uranium supply from scratch HALEU SMR LCOE EPC cost-plus\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-cheekypint-美国核燃料断供倒计时-2028年前必须自己造出浓缩铀/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a5900de8bd0ec158-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">59:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cheeky Pint</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>美国核燃料断供倒计时：2028年前必须自己造出浓缩铀</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">冷战后美国放弃了自己的铀浓缩产能，转而靠进口俄罗斯核燃料；国会定下2028年禁令，General Matter要抢在那之前建成本土产能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">核能</span><span class=\"tag\">铀浓缩</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Andrew Huberman’s Three Rules for Better Health and Focus NSDR / Yoga Nidra N-acetylcysteine (NAC) sex hormone binding globulin P5P\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-a16z-创始人每天只有两段黄金专注期-被打断代价是指数级的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">49:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>创始人每天只有两段黄金专注期，被打断代价是指数级的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Huberman说普通人一天真正高效的专注窗口通常只有两三段，这段时间被无关的事打断，损失的不是那几个小时，而是指数级拖累整体产出。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">健康习惯</span><span class=\"tag\">力量训练</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"K.C. Irving: Competing with Giants vertical integration Combines Investigation Act succession duties equal opportunity\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-knowledge-政府想用遗产税拆散家族企业-他干脆移居百慕大保住控制权/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6d457e7b70836700-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:03:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Knowledge Project</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>政府想用遗产税拆散家族企业，他干脆移居百慕大保住控制权</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">凯西·欧文六十年只信一条规则——重要的东西必须自己掌控。当新税制第一次威胁到这份100%所有权时，他选择带着全部财产离开新不伦瑞克。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">家族企业</span><span class=\"tag\">纵向整合</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Remembering Noah Adams Transgenic Pets pivot point sprinkler\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-throughline-战争博物馆里挂满英雄照-却没有一张受害者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">24:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>战争博物馆里挂满英雄照，却没有一张受害者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">诺亚·亚当斯90年代在贝尔格莱德军事博物馆的观察：两小时展品从九世纪弓箭到二战坦克，全是英雄影像，没有一张受害者照片——战争因此被讲述成了常态。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">NPR</span><span class=\"tag\">口述历史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"513 为永明时代作传：林晓光谈南齐武帝萧赜与南朝文学的爆发 检籍 土断 黄籍/白籍 永明声律\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-cn2aa250-近体诗平仄格律-本质是贵族社会的等级礼仪搬进了诗歌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:35:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>近体诗平仄格律，本质是贵族社会的等级礼仪搬进了诗歌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">南齐永明年间发现汉语四声只是起点，真正让近体诗定型的是贵族社会要求人人恰如其分嵌入等级秩序这套逻辑——内容平庸也算诗，平仄不合就不算诗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">南北朝</span><span class=\"tag\">贵族社会</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"An Election Day Special With Nate Silver dummymander elasticity digital twin generic ballot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-oddlots-民调不是在低估共和党-而是在怕错而过度修正/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">42:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>民调不是在低估共和党，而是在怕错而过度修正</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">缅因州一份民调把民主党原始9个点的领先，硬是用「可能投票模型」压成2个点——Nate Silver说这不是技术失误，是民调机构怕重蹈2016年低估特朗普覆辙后的自我保护。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国政治</span><span class=\"tag\">民调方法论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Q&amp;A: How to know if my child may have depression? internalizing issue externalizing warm handoff genetic loading\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-secureattach-四岁孩子反复说自己难过长达数月-值得认真对待/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">24:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>四岁孩子反复说自己难过长达数月，值得认真对待</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一个四岁男孩连续数月说自己难过却说不清原因，心理学家认为这已够格去做专业评估——幼儿抑郁罕见但确实存在，而且可以治疗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">儿童心理</span><span class=\"tag\">幼儿抑郁</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Ep 226 Glanders: Straight from the horse’s mouth Burkholderia mallei Burkholderia pseudomallei Farcy Tier 1 select agent Koch&#x27;s postulates\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-tpwky-鼻疽至今没有疫苗-防控唯一办法就是扑杀所有感染动物/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>鼻疽至今没有疫苗，防控唯一办法就是扑杀所有感染动物</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这种专性寄生在马属动物体内的细菌致死率超过90%，对抗生素天生耐药，人类研究了一百多年，唯一拿得出手的办法还是「发现就杀」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">传染病</span><span class=\"tag\">兽医史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"296: Avoidance Feeds Anxiety: When to Make Teens Do Hard Things | Dr. Meredith Elkins exposure-based therapy accommodation SPACE program\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-asklisa-父母越是心疼着接送孩子逃避-焦虑就越难治好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bc857b2c3fda762e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">43:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>父母越是心疼着接送孩子逃避，焦虑就越难治好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">回避带来的轻松会让大脑记住「这件事我搞不定」,下次更想逃；真正管用的办法是分级直面让自己不舒服的事，这套框架对轻度紧张和临床焦虑症同样有效。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">儿童心理</span><span class=\"tag\">焦虑障碍</span>\n</div></div></a>"]